    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\">You have an ancestral understanding of anatomy, where life is contained in a precious veil of flesh, and knowledge is a series of proliferating eyes away. When you take this feat, you choose between Organisght or Web of Eyes. You can cast your chosen spell once per day as an innate occult 4th rank spell.</span></p><p><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Special</span></span><span style=\"mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt;mso-bidi-font-family:Calibri;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-latin\"> You can take this feat twice, taking the other spell.</span></p>"
